<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">SHARE YOUR DAYS / 真实生活，给人灵感</view
  ><view class="title">分享一段生活</view
  ><view class="row wrap"
    ><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="preview"
      ><image
        class="thumb"
        src="{{item.preview}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtouchstart="startDrag"
        bindtouchmove="drag"
        bindtouchend="endDrag"
      /><view class="row mini"
        ><text data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="moveImage">前移</text
        ><text class="danger" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage"
          >移除</text
        ></view
      ></view
    ></view
  ><button wx:if="{{images.length&lt;3}}" class="secondary" bindtap="choose">
    ＋ 添加图片（最多3张）</button
  ><view class="muted" wx:if="{{images.length>1}}">左右拖动图片可调整顺序</view
  ><view class="field"
    ><label>今天有什么值得分享？</label
    ><textarea
      maxlength="500"
      value="{{content}}"
      data-key="content"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="分享你的退休生活，或你正在准备的生活……"
    /><view class="counter">{{content.length}}/500 · 至少10字</view></view
  ><view class="field"
    ><label>关联维度（必选，最多3个）</label
    ><view
      wx:for="{{dimensions}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="pill {{item.selected?'active':''}}"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="toggle"
      >{{item.icon}} {{item.name}}</view
    ></view
  ><view class="field"
    ><label>标签（可选，空格分隔，最多3个，每个8字）</label
    ><input
      maxlength="26"
      value="{{customTags}}"
      data-key="customTags"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="大理 院子" /></view
  ><view class="field"
    ><label>花费参考（可选）</label
    ><input
      maxlength="30"
      value="{{expense}}"
      data-key="expense"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="如：月花费约3500元" /></view
  ><view class="muted"
    >内容通过微信安全审核后公开展示。请勿填写联系方式等个人敏感信息。</view
  ><button
    class="primary"
    bindtap="save"
    loading="{{saving}}"
    disabled="{{saving || content.length&lt;10}}"
  >
    {{saving?'审核并发布中…':'发布生活分享'}}
  </button></view
>
